1
00:00:00,626 --> 00:00:03,046
HOWARD:
I'm busy too! You answer it!

2
00:00:03,211 --> 00:00:05,841
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
I can't! I'm on the toilet!

3
00:00:06,757 --> 00:00:08,677
HOWARD:
God's sake, I don't need to hear that!

4
00:00:08,842 --> 00:00:10,882
Can't you just say, "I'm busy?"

5
00:00:11,053 --> 00:00:14,723
MRS. WOLOWITZ: I said, "I'm busy,"
but that wasn't good enough for you!

6
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:17,270
HOWARD: I hope it's one
of those home invasion deals...

7
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:19,224
(Howard:)...and they shoot me in the head.

8
00:00:19,394 --> 00:00:24,604
MRS. WOLOWITZ: Well, if it's a home
invader, don't tell them I'm on the toilet!

9
00:00:28,028 --> 00:00:29,858
(Howard:)There's no one there.

10
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,070
(Howard:)You're hearing things,
you crazy old lady.

11
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,120
(Leonard:)Hey, Stuart. Have you seen Sheldon?

12
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:41,208
(Penny:)Yeah.
He's, uh, over in the graphic novel section.

13
00:00:43,085 --> 00:00:45,005
(Stuart:)Built himself a little nest.

14
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:47,212
(Penny:)Thank you.

15
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:48,927
(Stuart:)-Uh, Penny.
-Yeah?

16
00:00:49,091 --> 00:00:51,381
(Stuart:)-Is everything okay?
-What do you mean?

17
00:00:51,551 --> 00:00:54,011
(Stuart:)Uh, Sheldon told me you and Leonard
are having a fight.

18
00:00:54,179 --> 00:00:57,059
Oh, yeah, kind of. It's no big thing.

